_theotokionOfTroparion.text:
All of thy most glorious mysteries are beyond comprehension, O Theotokos;
for, thy purity sealed and thy virginity intact, thou art known to be a true Mother,
having given birth unto God.//
Him do thou entreat, that our souls be saved.

ode8.irmos:
Having spread his hands, Daniel closed the lions' jaws in their den;
while the zealously pious youths, girded with virtue,
quenched the power of the fire and cried aloud://
Bless ye the Lord, all ye works of the Lord.

